#. こ、ここだよ…
#. この脱衣所で見たんだよ…
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I-It was right here... I saw it right here in the\n"
"dressing room!"
msgstr ""

#. うぅ、なんかゾワゾワしてきたべ…
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Urg... I'm getting goosebumps..."
msgstr ""

#. エコエコエコエコエコエコエコエコエコエコ…
msgctxt "0003 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Ia! Ia! Cthulhu Fhtagn!"
msgstr ""

#. やめるべ！　降りてきたらどーすんだ！
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Shut up! What if he actually shows up!?"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈よ…どのあたりで不二咲の霊を見たのだ？
msgctxt "0005 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Hina...where was it you saw Chihiro's ghost?"
msgstr ""

#. なんか音が聞こえて…
#. ロッカーの扉を開けてみたら…
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Well, I heard a sound...and when I opened the\n"
"locker..."
msgstr ""

#. そしたら、ボウッと青白く光った不二咲ちゃんが…
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...I saw a kind of...pale outline of Chihiro..."
msgstr ""

#. エコエコエコエコエコエコエコエコエコエコ…
msgctxt "0008 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Ia! Ia! Cthulhu Fhtagn!"
msgstr ""

#. あのさ…
#. それって、なんなの…？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, um...what are you saying?"
msgstr ""

#. ウィッカの聖歌、その一部です…
#. ま、簡単に言いますと呪文のようなものですな。
msgctxt "0010 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's an ancient chant. Put simply, it's a kind of\n"
"incantation."
msgstr ""

#. だーかーら、やめるべー！
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "And that's why I said shut up!"
msgstr ""

#. ううぅぅ…
#. 苗木っち、早くすませちまうべ…
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Nng...! C'mon Makoto, let's hurry up and get this over\n"
"with!"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんが見たって言うのなら…
#. 何かが、このロッカーにあるんじゃないかしら…
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If Hina saw something as she claims, there might be\n"
"something here in the locker."
msgstr ""

#. ロッカーの扉を開けたら…
#. ボウッと青白く光った不二咲ちゃんが…
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I opened the locker door, and I saw a pale outline of\n"
"Chihiro..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In the locker, huh?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈は、ロッカーの扉を開けたと言ったな…
#. 調べてみるべきだろう…
msgctxt "0016 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hina said she opened the locker. We'd better check\n"
"that out..."
msgstr ""

#. さっさとロッカーを調べてしまいましょう…
msgctxt "0017 | CELES"
msgid "Let us hurry up and check the locker."
msgstr ""

#. そうすれば、こんなバカバカしいお話を
#. おしまいにできますわ。
msgctxt "0018 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The sooner we do that, the sooner we put this\n"
"ridiculous story to rest."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>えっと…このロッカーだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Umm, is this the locker...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この中に…何が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was something in here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんは、ロッカーって言ってたな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina said it was in the locker.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーを調べてみないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better check...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんは、ロッカーって言ってたな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina said it was in the locker.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーを調べてみないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better check...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんは、ロッカーって言ってたな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina said it was in the locker.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーを調べてみないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better check...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
